## Structure des Fichiers

### Frontend (apps/web)
```
src/
├── app/                    # Routes Next.js App Router
│   ├── (auth)/            # Auth pages (login, register)
│   ├── platform/          # Dashboard Super Admin
│   ├── reseller/          # Dashboard Revendeur
│   ├── restaurant/        # Dashboard Restaurant
│   ├── driver/            # App Livreur
│   └── store/[subdomain]/ # Storefront client
├── components/
│   ├── ui/                # shadcn/ui components
│   ├── shared/            # Composants partagés
│   ├── platform/          # Composants Super Admin
│   ├── reseller/          # Composants Revendeur
│   ├── restaurant/        # Composants Restaurant
│   └── storefront/        # Composants Storefront
├── hooks/                 # Custom hooks
├── lib/                   # Utils, api-client, auth
├── stores/                # Zustand stores
└── types/                 # Types TypeScript
```

### Backend (apps/api)
```
src/
├── routes/                # Express routes
│   ├── auth.routes.ts
│   ├── platform/          # Routes Super Admin
│   ├── reseller/          # Routes Revendeur
│   ├── restaurant/        # Routes Restaurant
│   └── public/            # Routes publiques (storefront)
├── controllers/           # Logique métier
├── middlewares/           # Auth, validation, error handling
├── services/              # Services externes (email, storage, payments)
├── validators/            # Schemas Zod
├── utils/                 # Helpers
└── types/                 # Types
```

