## Conventions de Nommage

| Type | Convention | Exemple |
|------|------------|---------|
| Composants | PascalCase | `SiteCard.tsx` |
| Hooks | camelCase avec use | `useSites.ts` |
| Utils | camelCase | `formatCurrency.ts` |
| Types/Interfaces | PascalCase | `interface Site {}` |
| Constants | SCREAMING_SNAKE | `MAX_SITES_PER_LICENSE` |
| Routes API | kebab-case | `/api/reseller/sites` |
| Fichiers routes | kebab-case | `sites.routes.ts` |
| Variables | camelCase | `const siteCount = 5` |
| Enums | PascalCase | `enum SiteStatus {}` |

