## Patterns Obligatoires

### Fetching Data (Frontend)
```typescript
// Utiliser TanStack Query
const { data, isLoading, error } = useQuery({
  queryKey: ['sites', organizationId],
  queryFn: () => api.reseller.getSites(),
})
```

### Mutations (Frontend)
```typescript
const mutation = useMutation({
  mutationFn: api.reseller.createSite,
  onSuccess: () => {
    queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ['sites'] })
    toast.success('Site créé')
  },
})
```

### Formulaires (Frontend)
```typescript
const form = useForm<CreateSiteInput>({
  resolver: zodResolver(createSiteSchema),
  defaultValues: { subdomain: '' },
})
```

### API Response (Backend)
```typescript
// Succès
res.json({ success: true, data: sites })

// Erreur
res.status(400).json({ success: false, error: 'INVALID_INPUT', message: 'Subdomain requis' })
```

### Validation (Backend)
```typescript
const createSiteSchema = z.object({
  subdomain: z.string().min(3).max(50).regex(/^[a-z0-9-]+$/),
  clientId: z.string().cuid().optional(),
})
```

